    the following effects of "Axon Kicker Oracle" once per turn. When your opponent
    would Special Summon a monster(s) (Quick Effect): You can negate the Summon,
    and if you do, banish that monster(s). If this Fusion Summoned card is sent to
    the GY: You can banish 1 "Teleport" Normal or Quick-Play Spell from your GY;
    Special Summon this card.'
